# Curated smoke set: one ROM per distinct hardware path.
# Paths are relative to the JaguarDemos clone root.
# Prefer vj.j64 / Model-M pads when upstream provides them for VirtualJaguar.
#
# Skips in-tree yarc.j64 / jagniccc.j64 (covered by make test + regression).
# voxelFlight has no committed .j64 (zip-only) — raycast_wip stands in for
# GPU/DSP-heavy rendering until a rebuild produces a cart image.

yarc_reloaded/cube.j64
jagniccc2000_reloaded/jagniccc.j64
jag_ball/jag_ball.j64
raycast_wip/rc.j64
nostalgia/nostalgia.j64
hirez_slideshow/slideshow.j64
256/Outline2026/Fountain/vj.j64
poly_engine/polygon.j64
